---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import ParkImage from "../assets/now/park-1.png";
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/pages/hero-about.png";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="Software engineer, side-project builder, splitting time between Detroit and Krakow."
		/>
		<style>
			.hero-image img {
				display: block;
				width: 100%;
				max-height: 440px;
				object-fit: cover;
				border-radius: 0;
			}
			@media (max-width: 720px) {
				.hero-image img { max-height: 220px; }
			}
			main {
				width: 700px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: auto;
				padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
			}
			.page-header {
				margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
				padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
			}
			.page-header h1 {
				margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
				font-size: 2rem;
			}
			.page-header p {
				margin: 0;
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}
			.intro {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 1.5rem;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
			}
			.intro-photo {
				width: 96px !important;
				max-width: 96px !important;
				height: 96px;
				flex-shrink: 0;
				border-radius: 12px;
				object-fit: cover;
				object-position: center top;
				margin: 0 !important;
			}
			.intro-text h2 {
				margin: 0 0 0.15rem 0;
				font-size: 1.25rem;
			}
			.intro-text p {
				margin: 0;
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				font-size: 0.925rem;
			}
			.prose p {
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				line-height: 1.7;
				margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
			}
			.social-row {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1rem;
				margin-top: 2rem;
				padding-top: 1.5rem;
				border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
			}
			.social-row a {
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				color: var(--accent);
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.social-row a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}
			@media (max-width: 540px) {
				.intro {
					flex-direction: column;
					align-items: flex-start;
					gap: 1rem;
				}
			}
			.captioned-image {
				margin: 1.75rem 0;
			}
			.captioned-image img {
				margin: 0;
			}
			@media (max-width: 720px) {
				.captioned-image img {
					width: 100%;
					max-width: 100%;
					margin: 0;
					border-radius: 8px;
				}
			}
			.captioned-image figcaption {
				margin-top: 0.6rem;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-style: italic;
				font-size: 0.88rem;
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				text-align: center;
			}

		</style>
	</head>

	<body>
		<Header />
		<div class="hero-image">
			<Image src={AboutHeroImage} alt="About page hero" loading="eager" />
		</div>
		<main>
			<div class="page-header">
				<h1>About</h1>
				<p>A little more about me and what I'm doing here.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="intro">
				<img src="/profiles/mkumm.png" alt="Michael Kumm" class="intro-photo" />
				<div class="intro-text">
					<h2>Michael Kumm</h2>
					<p>Senior Software Engineer</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="prose">
<p>I'm a software engineer at DraftKings. Over a 30+ year career, I've moved between technology, leadership, and operations, but I find building software the most challenging and the most fun. </p>
<p>I still build things for fun. Side projects give me an excuse to learn something new, revisit something I only half understand (a lot of material to choose there), or take a topic I already know and go much deeper. I set aside a good amount of time for learning, and I'm happiest when I'm working on something that deepens my understanding.</p>
<p>Away from a computer, I like to read, cook, walk, take photos, create music, ride my bike, and play a variety of sports, non competitively. </p>
<p>This site is where I write about some of that: software, projects, things I'm trying to understand, and whatever else - a personal eclectic mix of topics. </p>
<p>I visit Poland often and I am very slowly working my way through learning the language.  </p>

			<figure class="captioned-image">
				<Image src={ParkImage} alt="A park in Krakow" loading="lazy" layout="constrained" width={1400} />
				<figcaption>One of the many parks I bike through in Krakow.</figcaption>
			</figure>
			</div>

			<div class="social-row">
				<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/mkumm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/mkumm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
